---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import OrnamentalDivider from '../components/OrnamentalDivider.astro';
---

<Layout title="About the Author" description="Learn about the person behind The Archive — background, interests, and the purpose of this publication." compactHeader={true}>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="about">

      <header class="about__header">
        <div class="about__bookplate">
          <div class="about__bookplate-inner">
            <span class="about__bookplate-label label">Ex Libris</span>
            <h1 class="about__title">About the Author</h1>
            <OrnamentalDivider variant="diamond" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="about__content prose">
        <p>
          Welcome, reader. This publication serves as a personal repository — part commonplace book,
          part broadsheet, part laboratory notebook. Here you will find essays, study notes, reports,
          and documentation of ongoing projects, all gathered under a single roof and presented with
          the care they deserve.
        </p>

        <h2>The Purpose</h2>

        <p>
          In an age of ephemeral content and algorithmic feeds, this site is an intentional act of
          slowness. Every piece published here is written to endure — to be read and re-read, to
          accumulate meaning over time. The vintage aesthetic is not mere decoration; it is a
          statement of values. Substance over spectacle. Depth over velocity.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
          <p>
            "A commonplace book is what a provident poet cannot subsist without, for this proverbial
            reason, that great wits have short memories."
          </p>
          <footer>— Jonathan Swift</footer>
        </blockquote>

        <h2>What You'll Find</h2>

        <p>The Archive is organized into four sections:</p>

        <ul>
          <li><strong>Blog Posts</strong> — personal essays, reflections, and longform writing on topics that spark curiosity</li>
          <li><strong>Study Notes</strong> — structured notes from courses, books, and self-directed learning</li>
          <li><strong>Reports</strong> — in-depth analyses and research on specific subjects</li>
          <li><strong>Projects</strong> — documentation of ongoing and completed work</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>The Craft</h2>

        <p>
          This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, typeset in
          <em>Playfair Display</em> and <em>EB Garamond</em>, and deployed as static HTML — the most
          durable format on the web. No tracking scripts. No cookie banners. No algorithms deciding
          what you should read next. Just words on a page, as it ought to be.
        </p>

        <OrnamentalDivider variant="stars" />

        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>

        <p>
          Correspondence is welcome. You may reach the author by electronic mail or through the
          usual channels. For updates, subscribe to the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> — a
          technology as reliable as the morning post.
        </p>
      </div>

    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: var(--sp-2xl) 0;
  }

  .about__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-2xl);
  }

  .about__bookplate {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--sp-2xl) var(--sp-3xl);
    border: 3px double var(--border-dark);
    position: relative;
  }

  .about__bookplate::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about__bookplate-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about__bookplate-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-sm);
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
  }

  .about__title {
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .about__content {
    padding-top: var(--sp-xl);
  }

  .about__content blockquote footer {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-style: normal;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--sp-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about__bookplate {
      padding: var(--sp-lg) var(--sp-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
